"\n"
"If there is anything you’re missing, please contact us via our website on "
"eventyay.com.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hai,\n"
"\n"
"Kami berharap Anda puas dengan eventyay sebagai sistem CfP acara Anda.\n"
"Tautan ini mungkin berguna dalam beberapa hari dan minggu ke depan:\n"
"\n"
"- Dasbor acara Anda: {event_dashboard}\n"
"- Daftar proposal: {event_submissions}\n"
"- Editor jadwal Anda: {event_schedule}\n"
"\n"
"Jika ada yang Anda butuhkan, silakan hubungi kami melalui situs web kami di "
"eventyay.com.\n"

#: eventyay/base/models/settings.py:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"just writing you to let you know that your Call for Participation is now\n"
"closed. Here is a list of links that should be useful in the next days:\n"
"\n"
"- You’ll find a list of all your {submission_count} proposals here:\n"
"  {event_submissions}\n"
"- You can add reviewers here:\n"
"  {event_team}\n"
"- You can review proposals here:\n"
"  {event_review}\n"
"- And create your schedule here, once you have accepted proposals:\n"
"  {event_schedule}\n"
msgstr ""
"Hai,\n"
"\n"
"kami menulis untuk memberi tahu Anda bahwa Pengajuan Proposal Anda sekarang "
"ditutup. Berikut daftar tautan yang mungkin berguna dalam beberapa hari ke "
"depan:\n"
"\n"
"- Anda dapat menemukan daftar semua proposal {submission_count} Anda di "
"sini:\n"
"  {event_submissions}\n"
"- Anda dapat menambahkan penilai di sini:\n"
"  {event_team}\n"
"- Anda dapat menilai proposal di sini:\n"
"  {event_review}\n"
"- Dan membuat jadwal Anda di sini, setelah Anda menerima proposal:\n"
"  {event_schedule}\n"

#: eventyay/base/models/settings.py:112
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"congratulations, your event is over! Hopefully it went well. Here are some\n"
"statistics you might find interesting:\n"
"\n"
"- You had {submission_count} proposals,\n"
"- Of which you selected {talk_count} sessions.\n"
"- The reviewers wrote {review_count} reviews.\n"
"- You released {schedule_count} schedules in total.\n"
"- Over the course of the event, you sent {mail_count} mails.\n"
"\n"
"If there is anything you’re missing, please contact us via our website on "
"eventyay.com.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hai,\n"
"\n"
"Selamat, acara Anda telah selesai! Semoga berjalan lancar. Berikut beberapa "
"statistik yang mungkin menarik bagi Anda:\n"
"\n"
"- Anda memiliki {submission_count} proposal,\n"
"- Dari proposal tersebut, Anda memilih {talk_count} sesi.\n"
"- Para peninjau menulis {review_count} ulasan.\n"
"- Anda merilis total {schedule_count} jadwal.\n"
"- Sepanjang acara, Anda mengirimkan {mail_count} email.\n"
"\n"
"Jika ada yang Anda butuhkan, silakan hubungi kami melalui situs web kami di "
"eventyay.com.\n"

